# Observability

## What belongs here

- **Signals** — the metrics, logs and traces this service emits, and what each one answers.
- **SLOs** — the objectives that make "healthy" a measurable statement rather than an opinion.
- **Alerts** — which symptoms page a human, and which merely open a ticket.
- **Dashboards** — where to look first when an alert fires.

## The rule

Every alert links to a runbook, and every runbook names the alert that leads to it. An alert
without a runbook is an alert that will be ignored at the moment it matters most.
